+Modified map font, 2026-11-23.
+
+The file NotoSansJP-Regular.ttf in this directory is a modified font.
+Its name table identifies it as Truth Seeker Map, not as an unmodified Noto or Source release.
+Eight glyphs were added from Noto Sans Regular (Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors, SIL OFL 1.1):
+U+A723, U+A725, U+2070, U+2075, U+2076, U+2077, U+2078, U+2079.
+The unmodified Noto Sans JP file used as the base is kept in repair_backups for this repair.
+Reserved Font Name in the notice below: Source. This derivative does not use that name.
